r built on invented sources.\n\n### 3. If your paper topic is real — I can find real sources right now\nThere is genuine, peer-reviewed scholarship on silence typology and non-verbal communication in Pacific cultures. Let me search for it. A well-argued paper using three or four real sources is infinitely better than one built on a fictitious monograph.\n\n---\n\n## My Strong Recommendation\n\nPlease verify this source through your library **before writing another word of your paper.** I'm here and ready to help you find real scholarship the moment you'd like me to. Shall I start searching now?",
