cific cultures. I can help you find it.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ I Can Help You With Real Sources\n\nIf your research interest is in **non-verbal communication, silence typologies, or Pacific linguistic anthropology**, I can search for genuine, verifiable works on those topics — for example:\n- Deborah Tannen & Muriel Saville-Troike's edited volume *Perspectives on Silence* (1985)\n- Muriel Saville-Troike's foundational work on communicative silence\n- Peer-reviewed articles in the *Journal of Linguistic Anthropology* or *Oceania* on Pacific communication norms\n\nWould you like me to help you find real, verified sources on these themes instead?",
